completed_at: "2026-08-03T22:25:54.080Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: "docs/ gains a composability/scripting reference: exit-code table (success/not-found/validation/conflict/lock classes), the rule that data goes to stdout and diagnostics to stderr, JSON field-name stability policy, and worked grep/jq/xargs recipes; a gate-style spec asserts the exit codes and stream discipline for representative commands so regressions fail CI; README links the reference"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Published and test-gated the CLI scripting process, structured-output, filter, and composition contract."
expected_result: "Scripts have a documented exit-code table, stdout/stderr discipline, stable structured fields, and executable jq/xargs recipes."
actual_result: "docs/SCRIPTING.md is linked from both indexes; dedicated integration gates prove exits 0/2/3/4 and stdout/stderr separation, while contract snapshots and consumer tests pass."
